<title>MEXICO: Mexico's ICA eyes Nayarit road contract.</title>
<headline>Mexico's ICA eyes Nayarit road contract.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's largest construction firm Empresas ICA has put forward a proposal to the state government of Nayarit to build a highwway in the north of the Pacific coast state.</p>
<p>In a statement, ICA said the 224 km long road would run from the town of San Blas to the limits of neighboring Sinaloa state and would follow the current federal highway number 15. -- Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara bureau (523) 817-0397</p>
</text>
